# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Re-include this suite's markdown.
#
# The REPO ROOT .gitignore has `**.md` with only `!README.md` negated, so every
# other markdown file is ignored repo-wide. That would silently drop this
# suite's ledgers -- the per-UC `coverage.md` (coverage audit trail) and
# `defects.md` (the queue that feeds Jira), plus the two guides BA/QA read them
# with. They would exist on disk, pass every check, and never be committed.
#
# A nested .gitignore may re-include files a parent pattern excluded, provided
# no parent DIRECTORY is excluded -- the root only excludes *.md files, so this
# works. Scoped to this folder so the repo-wide policy is untouched.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!*.md
!**/*.md
